    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> be the centroid of the triangle with vertices <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> , <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> . Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> be the point of intersection of the lines <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> and <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> . Then, the line passing through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> also passes through the point:",
